stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> CONNECTED
    CONNECTED --> WAITING_GAZEBO : waiting for Gazebo odometry
    WAITING_GAZEBO --> CHECKING_OUTPUT_MAP : checking direct lateral outputs
    CHECKING_OUTPUT_MAP --> COMMANDING : FCU servo commands drive Gazebo outputs
    COMMANDING --> STOPPING : sending neutral PWM and zero Gazebo thrust
    STOPPING --> COMPLETE : interval ended and Gazebo thrust was zeroed
    COMPLETE --> [*]
